WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:03.480
This melody is very sad.

00:05.400 --> 00:07.880
This is for the dead below the walls.

00:07.960 --> 00:13.040
Learned from the granny with the best musical skill in the fort they say.

00:13.160 --> 00:16.000
This melody can soothe the departed.

00:17.040 --> 00:22.080
Actually, I think what really needs soothing isn't the departed.

00:24.720 --> 00:31.080
In our Shitou Fortress people often use the time of one melody to say goodbye.

00:31.200 --> 00:34.040
To grieve to remember.

00:35.200 --> 00:37.040
Then quickly forget the pain.

00:38.480 --> 00:39.840
To live on properly.

00:41.520 --> 00:44.600
Why follow the volunteers to a dangerous place like Yiyang?

00:46.480 --> 00:51.240
Grandfather is my only family if I don't follow him where else can I go?

